 shining of the heavenly expanse, and those who turn many to righteousness, like the stars, forever and ever.","tok":[{"t":"And those who have insight will "},{"t":"shine","s":["H2094"],"a":[1]},{"t":" like the shining of the heavenly expanse, and those who turn "},{"t":"many","s":["H7227"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6663"],"a":[4]},{"t":", like the "},{"t":"stars","s":["H3556"],"a":[6]},{"t":", "},{"t":"forever","s":["H5769"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"ever","s":["H5703"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"But you, Daniel, shut up the words and seal the book until the time of the end; many will go here and there, and knowledge will be increased.","tok":[{"t":"But you, "},{"t":"Daniel","s":["H1840"],"a":[1]},{"t":", shut "},{"t":"up","s":["H5640"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"seal","s":["H2856"],"a":[4]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"book","s":["H5612"],"a":[5]},{"t":" until the "},{"t":"time","s":["H6256"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"end","s":["H7093"],"a":[8]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"many","s":["H7227"],"a":[10]},{"t":" will go here and there, and "},{"t":"knowledge","s":["H1847"],"a":[12]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"increased","s":["H7235"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Then I, Daniel, looked, and there were two others standing, one on this bank of the river and the other on that bank of the river.","tok":[{"t":"Then I, "},{"t":"Daniel","s":["H1840"],"a":[2]},{"t":", "},{"t":"looked","s":["H7200"],"a":[0]},{"t":", and there were "},{"t":"two","s":["H8147"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"others","s":["H0312"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"standing","s":["H8147"],"a":[4]},{"t":", "},{"t":"one","s":["H0259"],"a":[7]},{"t":" on this "},{"t":"bank","s":["H8193"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"river","s":["H2975"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"other","s":["H0259"],"a":[11]},{"t":" on that "},{"t":"bank","s":["H8193"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"river","s":["H2975"],"a":[14]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"An