gs will be completed."}]},{"n":8,"text":"And I heard, but I did not understand. Then I said, My Lord, what will the latter end of these things be?","tok":[{"t":"And I "},{"t":"heard","s":["H8085"],"a":[1]},{"t":", but I did not understand. Then I "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[4]},{"t":", My "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0113"],"a":[5]},{"t":", what will the latter "},{"t":"end","s":["H0319"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of these things be?"}]},{"n":9,"text":"And He said, Go your way, Daniel, for the words are shut up and sealed until the time of the end.","tok":[{"t":"And He "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":", Go your "},{"t":"way","s":["H3212"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Daniel","s":["H1840"],"a":[2]},{"t":", for the "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[6]},{"t":" are shut "},{"t":"up","s":["H5640"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"sealed","s":["H2856"],"a":[5]},{"t":" until the "},{"t":"time","s":["H6256"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"end","s":["H7093"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Many will be purified, cleansed, and refined, but the wicked will act wickedly; and none of the wicked will understand, but those who have insight will understand.","tok":[{"t":"Many","s":["H7227"],"a":[3]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"purified","s":["H1305"],"a":[0]},{"t":", cleansed, and refined, but the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will act "},{"t":"wickedly","s":["H7561"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; and none of the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[9]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"understand","s":["H0995"],"a":[7]},{"t":", but those who have insight will "},{"t":"understand","s":["H0995"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"And from the time that the daily sacrifice is removed and the abomination that desolates is set up, there will be a thousand two hundred and ninety days.","tok":[{"t":"And from the "},{"t":"time","s":["H6256"],"a":[0]},{"t":" that the "},{"t":"daily","s":["H8548"],"a":[2]},{"t":" sacrifice is removed and the "},{"t":"abomination","s":["H8251"],"a":[4]},{"t":" that "},{"t":"de